<title>JAPAN: Komatsu Zenoah - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Komatsu Zenoah - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 21.15		vs	   19.28</p>
<p> Operating	  325    million    vs	   99    million</p>
<p> Current	    160    million    vs	   36    million</p>
